    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6a4d10a2db3e33443c934501/irdMfzJrd0ev_YEJVpt22.png) ⟨28⟩\nRoxasYTB⟨28⟩\n/\ncores_es-ljspeech⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nModalities:  Audio ⟨30⟩\nTags:  audio ⟨31⟩ voice ⟨32⟩ portal ⟨33⟩ piper-tts ⟨34⟩ ljspeech ⟨35⟩\nLicense:\ncc-by-4.0\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨36⟩ Community ⟨37⟩\nDataset Viewer\nThe dataset viewer is not available for this subset.\nCannot get the split names for the config 'default' of the dataset.\n\n```\nException:    SplitsNotFoundError\nMessage:      The split names could not be parsed from the dataset config.\nTraceback:    Traceback (most recent call last):\n                File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.14/site-packages/datasets/inspect.py\", line 286, in get_dataset_config_info\n                  for split_generator in builder._split_generators(\n                                         ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^\n                      StreamingDownloadManager(base_path=builder.base_path, download_config=download_config)\n                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^